vani-ieee80211
Copyright Pratik M. Tambe <enthusiasticgeek@gmail.com> and The vani-ieee80211 Authors

This product includes IEEE 802.11 management-frame build/parse logic
(Probe Request/Response, Open System Authentication, Association
Request/Response) and the WPA2-PSK/CCMP RSN Information Element,
extracted from Dhruva OS's own WPA2 4-way handshake work as a
standalone library.

